      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "What the fuck do I do with the honing points? \n\nWhy are the mobs getting stronger instead? \n- the whole point of honing is to make the mobs stronger or debuff yourself enough but not detrimental to yourself clearing the stages, soul orb levels and stars makes a huge difference on how many stages you can clear.",
