      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "Honing points priority \n- character move spd (literally doesn’t affect you much, takes 4 honing points) \n- skill cool down (slight delay in DPS, mobs not buffed) \n \nThese 2 doesn’t affect your character too much, so you can still DPS with ease. Subsequent ones are based on what stages you clear till for special honing points, remember you can read the skills and effects.",
