    {
      "id": "1148125408861106248",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2023-09-04T01:20:28.611-04:00",
      "timestampEdited": "2023-09-04T01:32:22.293-04:00",
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "What I spend on for tower of origins?\n\nFirstly, what type of player are you? P2W or F2P?\n\nP2W\n1. evil spirit fragments to open up soul blooms \n2. Enchanting stone to unlock total levels \n3. You probably won’t need balrog since you’re maxed already. \n4. Once you’re done with bloom, proceed to save up for new orbs. \n\nF2P \n1. Highly suggest balrog fragments till he’s red base at least \n2. Continue saving for better soul orbs that’s gonna release in the upcoming future\n3. Evil spirit fragments in the future since they require certain amount of stars to unlock as pre requisite\n4. Tower of Origin f2p, if they have 1x Ephenia already, they can buy Balrog Shards until total star level 10,unlock level 2 soul bloom then focus max Balrog for optimisation",
      "author": {
        "id": "584449248935018516",
        "name": "elian4245",
